on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 33 .............................. <marker(0)>
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  9] add ..................................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 12] extcall 4 ............................... go(marker(0) + 1)
  [ 14] ret
end
